# Schema geo

## Class Diagram

```mermaid
classDiagram
    direction TB
    class Entity {
        <<Abstract>>
    }
    class Part {
        <<Part>>
    }
    class Landmark
    Entity <|-- Landmark
    Landmark --> Landmark : NEAR (many)
    Landmark *-- Part : PARTS (many)
```

## Types

### Entity

*Abstract type* — no direct instances.

| Property | Type | Modifiers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | `UUID` | primary |  |

### Part

*Part type* — instances exist only as composed children.

| Property | Type | Modifiers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `label` | `String` | primary |  |

### Landmark

Extends: [Entity](#entity).

| Property | Type | Modifiers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `code` | `String` |  |  |
| `id` | `UUID` | primary, from Entity |  |

**Associations**

- `--> NEAR (many)` [Landmark](#landmark)

**Compositions**

- `*-> PARTS (many)` [Part](#part)
